<title>SINGAPORE: Pan United 1996 net up 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Pan United 1996 net up 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in million of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			18.37    vs    16.82</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	     8.00    vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	    3.40   vs     3.10</p>
<p>    Turnover			 272.50   vs   157.82</p>
<p>    Other income (incl interest) 2.33   vs     2.22</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)	     1.51   vs     0.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  26.01   vs    20.75</p>
<p>    Dividend pay/register	 June 17/June 7</p>
<p>Note - Pan-United Corp Ltd is involved in shipping, ship building and repair services and in services related to the supply of refined petroleum products for marine and industrial use.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
